OL,3,GNEWSAAnonymous donor gives girl 'second
OL,4,Achance at life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Knowing that there is someone willing
OL,7,Fto donate their stem cells and give me
OL,8,Fanother chance at life means more to me
OL,9,Fthan I could ever put into words", Dye
OL,10,Fsaid.
